[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 4.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Mr. Malamboi", "start": 8.639, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Malmbe, Minister for Foreign Affairs and", "start": 11.36, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "International Cooperation of Zambia.", "start": 14.559, "duration": 5.241}, {"text": ">> I request protocol to escort his", "start": 20.64, "duration": 5.399}, {"text": "excellency", "start": 23.039, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "the President of the General Assembly,", "start": 37.52, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "the Secretary General,", "start": 41.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 44.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "distinguished heads of state and", "start": 45.84, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "government, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 48.079, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "we congratulate you, Mr. president on", "start": 53.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "your election as the president of the", "start": 56.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "81st session of the United Nations", "start": 59.12, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "General Assembly and pledge our", "start": 61.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "cooperation and support during your", "start": 64.159, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "tenure. We also commend the Secretary", "start": 66.72, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "General for his strong leadership at a", "start": 69.68, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "challenging time in our multilateral", "start": 73.119, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "system.", "start": 75.439, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Zambia continues", "start": 76.88, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "uh to salute his excellency Antonio", "start": 79.36, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "Gutirez for reminding us that the answer", "start": 83.119, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "to a more divided and multipolar world", "start": 87.119, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "is not less multilateralism", "start": 91.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "but a stronger fairer and more", "start": 94.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "representative United Nations.", "start": 97.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The theme of this session, restoring", "start": 101.6, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "trust, managing transformation, a united", "start": 104.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "nations that delivers for all, is both", "start": 108.479, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "timely and necessary.", "start": 111.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Trust is the foundation on which", "start": 114.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "international cooperation is built upon.", "start": 117.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Yet today trust in institutions, trust", "start": 119.84, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "amongst nations and most importantly", "start": 123.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "trust between the institutions that", "start": 126.799, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "serve the people is under strain.", "start": 129.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Trust means that the found founding", "start": 133.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "principles of the United Nations charter", "start": 135.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "must be respected for Zambia. Trust", "start": 138.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "begins with keeping promises.", "start": 142.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Trust means that international", "start": 145.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "agreements must be honored.", "start": 147.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Trust means that development commitments", "start": 149.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "must be financed.", "start": 152.959, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Trust means that the voices of", "start": 155.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "developing countries matter in a world", "start": 157.12, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "in a in word and in deed. Trust means", "start": 160.959, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "the global system must not protect the", "start": 165.519, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "interests of the powerful at the expense", "start": 168.879, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "of the vulnerable.", "start": 171.599, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "And trust means that when the world", "start": 175.04, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "agrees on a goal, we must have the", "start": 177.28, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "commitment to implement it. The world is", "start": 180.08, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "under undergoing profound", "start": 183.599, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 185.519, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "Technology is changing. Economies and", "start": 187.12, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "societies.", "start": 190.08, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "Uh climate change is reshaping", "start": 191.599, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "livelihoods. Geopolitical competition is", "start": 193.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "altering global trade and investment", "start": 196.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "patterns. conflicts are causing massive", "start": 199.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "displacements and humanitarian", "start": 201.84, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "suffering.", "start": 204.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "And yet developing countries continue to", "start": 205.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "confront a financing system that does", "start": 209.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "not adequately reflect and respond to", "start": 212.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "their development needs. The question", "start": 214.959, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "before us is therefore not whether", "start": 217.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "transformation will happen, but it is", "start": 220.319, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "rather how we manage transformation, who", "start": 223.36, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "benefits from it, and whether our", "start": 226.56, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "multilateral institutions are capable of", "start": 228.879, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "delivering meaningful results for", "start": 232.159, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "ordinary people. For Zambia, the answer", "start": 234.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "is clear. We must restore trust by", "start": 238.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "achieving results. And we must manage", "start": 241.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transformation by ensuring that no", "start": 244.4, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "country and no one is left behind.", "start": 247.04, "duration": 9.439}, {"text": "Zambia's democratic journey and the 2026", "start": 253.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "elections.", "start": 256.479, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mr. President, article 21 of the", "start": 258.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Universal Declaration of Human Rights", "start": 261.359, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "affirms that we that the will I'll read", "start": 264.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "that again. Article 21 of the Universal", "start": 268.08, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Declaration of Human Rights affirms that", "start": 271.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "the will of the people shall be the", "start": 274.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "basis of the authority of government", "start": 276.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "expressed through periodic and genuine", "start": 279.44, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "elections.", "start": 282.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "It is in this spirit that Zambia", "start": 284.479, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "recently concluded its general elections", "start": 286.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "through which our people exercised their", "start": 290.08, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "constitutional rights to choose their", "start": 292.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "leaders.", "start": 294.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "And we thank the people of Zambia for", "start": 296.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "their participation in the democratic", "start": 299.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "process and for renewing their", "start": 301.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "confidence in our leadership.", "start": 303.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "We also", "start": 307.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "express our sincere appreciation to the", "start": 310.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "international election observation", "start": 313.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "missions for their invaluable support", "start": 315.52, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "and contribution to Zambia's democratic", "start": 318.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "process.", "start": 321.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Zambia remains a peaceful, stable and", "start": 323.759, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "sovereign nation and the peaceful", "start": 327.84, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "atmosphere that characterized the", "start": 330.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "country before, during and after the", "start": 332.32, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "elections is a clear reflection of our", "start": 336.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "people's enduring commitment to", "start": 338.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "democracy, national unity and", "start": 341.52, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "constitutional governance. It is against", "start": 345.28, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "this backdrop that Zambia has put itself", "start": 348.16, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "forward as a candidate for the 2027 to", "start": 351.199, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "2029 Human Rights Council and we seek", "start": 355.52, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "your support in that regard.", "start": 359.52, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Mr. President, despite the political", "start": 364.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "differences that naturally accompany a", "start": 366.96, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "democratic election, Zambia has", "start": 369.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "demonstrated that such differences can", "start": 372.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "and must be managed peacefully and", "start": 375.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "through the established constitutional", "start": 378.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and legal institutions. Our democratic", "start": 380.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "process should never be mistaken for", "start": 383.6, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "conflict or instability. We therefore", "start": 386.4, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "reaffirm our unwavering commitment to", "start": 390.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "preserving Zambia's long-standing", "start": 393.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "tradition of peace.", "start": 395.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "We will continue to ensure that", "start": 398.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "political differences are addressed", "start": 400.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "through due process of the law and will", "start": 402.88, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "take all necessary measures within the", "start": 405.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "confines of the constitution", "start": 409.039, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "and our laws to prevent political", "start": 411.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "disputes from degenerating into", "start": 414.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "violence, armed mobilization,", "start": 417.28, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "insurgency or the emergence of militia", "start": 420.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "groups", "start": 425.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "In this regard, we extend a sincere", "start": 427.36, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "invitation to cooperating partners,", "start": 430.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "international development institutions,", "start": 433.599, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "investors, the private sector, and", "start": 436.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Zambia's friends around the world to", "start": 438.8, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "continue working with us in advancing", "start": 441.199, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "our grow Zambia agenda.", "start": 444.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Zambia needs partnerships,", "start": 447.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "investments, innovation, technology,", "start": 450.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "skills, and sustained development", "start": 453.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "cooperation in order to unlock its full", "start": 455.039, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "potential.", "start": 458.639, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We encourage our cooperating partners to", "start": 462.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "view Zambia through the lens of the", "start": 464.4, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "peace and stability that defines our", "start": 467.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "country and to deepen support programs", "start": 470.319, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "that promote inclusive economic growth,", "start": 473.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "job creation, infrastructure", "start": 477.039, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "development, human capital development,", "start": 479.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "agriculture, energy, health and other", "start": 482.319, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "priority areas of national development.", "start": 485.52, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Our message is clear.", "start": 489.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Zambia is at peace. Zambia is open for", "start": 492.96, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "partnership and Zambia is ready to grow.", "start": 496.16, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 502.0, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "peace and stability provide the", "start": 504.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "foundation for economic development.", "start": 506.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Zambia is positioning itself as an", "start": 509.52, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "attractive destination for investment", "start": 512.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and trade with opportunities in mining,", "start": 515.519, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "critical minerals, agriculture,", "start": 519.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "agroprocessing, manufacturing, energy", "start": 521.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "infrastructure,", "start": 524.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "tourism and digital digital services.", "start": 526.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Our ambition, our ambition is to move", "start": 528.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "beyond the export of raw materials and", "start": 531.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "primary commodities towards value", "start": 535.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "addition, industrialization,", "start": 537.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "job creation and technology transfer as", "start": 540.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "key enablers of our economic", "start": 543.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "transformation agenda.", "start": 546.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We welcome investment that creates jobs,", "start": 548.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "develops skills, and builds sustainable", "start": 552.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "value chains. Our message to investors", "start": 554.8, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "is come to Zambia, invest with us,", "start": 557.76, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "produce with us, trade with us and grow", "start": 562.8, "duration": 9.599}, {"text": "with us. We are open for development.", "start": 567.12, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "Mr. President, I now turn to climate", "start": 572.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "change and environmental resilience,", "start": 575.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "water and sanitation.", "start": 578.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "For Zambia, climate change is not an", "start": 580.959, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "abstract concept. Our people continue to", "start": 583.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "experience the devastating effects of", "start": 588.08, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "droughts, floods, and changing weather", "start": 590.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "patterns with significant impact on", "start": 593.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "agriculture, food security, water", "start": 596.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "availability, energy generation, and", "start": 599.2, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "livelihoods.", "start": 601.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The effects of activities transcend", "start": 603.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "our borders, and yet our people and the", "start": 607.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "coming generations may pay a heavy", "start": 610.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "price. Zambia recognizes that countries", "start": 612.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "such as ours cannot finance the climate", "start": 616.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "transition alone, nor should they. This", "start": 619.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "is a collective moral responsibility of", "start": 623.2, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the international community, especially", "start": 626.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the highest contributors to carbon", "start": 628.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "emissions. This is to mitigate the", "start": 630.72, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "effects of climate change and protect", "start": 633.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "lives and livelihoods. Those who have", "start": 635.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "contributed least to climate change must", "start": 638.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "not be left to bear its greatest costs.", "start": 641.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "We therefore call for predictable,", "start": 645.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "accessible, and affordable climate", "start": 647.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "finance, technology transfer, and", "start": 650.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "greater investment in adaptation and", "start": 652.8, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "resilience consistent with the principle", "start": 655.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "of common but differentiated", "start": 658.079, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "responsibilities", "start": 660.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and respective capabilities.", "start": 662.0, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "For Africa, adaptation is not optional.", "start": 665.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Our farmers require client made", "start": 668.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "resilient agriculture. Our communities", "start": 671.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "and cities need resilient", "start": 673.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "infrastructure. Our energy systems must", "start": 675.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "become more diversified. And our water", "start": 678.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "sources, forests, and ecosystems must be", "start": 681.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "protected.", "start": 684.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Zambia is ready to contribute to global", "start": 686.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "climate solutions. But those that have", "start": 689.68, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "contributed least to climate change must", "start": 692.959, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "not bear disproportionate share of its", "start": 695.839, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "costs. Water security is integral to", "start": 699.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "climate resilience and sustainable", "start": 703.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "development. Zambia therefore attaches", "start": 705.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "great importance to international", "start": 708.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "cooperation on water and has actively", "start": 710.56, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "participated in the preparatory process", "start": 713.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of the 2026 United Nations water", "start": 716.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "conference together with Finland.", "start": 718.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Zambia is co-chairing the initiative", "start": 722.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "dialogue on water for cooperation", "start": 725.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "focusing on transboundary and", "start": 728.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international water cooperation,", "start": 730.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "scientific cooperation and inclusive", "start": 732.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "governance. We remain committed to", "start": 735.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "strengthening water security, climate", "start": 739.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "res resilience,", "start": 741.76, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and sustainable management of water", "start": 743.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "resources while working with the", "start": 746.16, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "international community to ensure that", "start": 748.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "climate and water action delivers", "start": 750.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "tangible benefits for our people and", "start": 752.959, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "future generations.", "start": 756.16, "duration": 6.679}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 759.44, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "Africa's youthful population is one of", "start": 763.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "our greatest assets and represents an", "start": 766.399, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "enormous opportunity for global", "start": 769.279, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "prosperity.", "start": 771.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "For global prosperity according to", "start": 772.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "democrat demographic forecasts,", "start": 774.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "one in every four youths on the globe", "start": 777.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "will be African by 2050. We have a", "start": 780.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "wealth of young Africans with potential", "start": 783.279, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "to become entrepreneurs, scientists,", "start": 785.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "engineers, farmers, innovators and", "start": 788.639, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "artists", "start": 790.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "uh and indeed future leaders. Our", "start": 792.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "responsibility is to equip them with", "start": 795.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "quality education, relevant skills,", "start": 796.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "access to technology, entrepreneur,", "start": 799.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "entrepreneurship opportunities and", "start": 802.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "decent employment so that they can", "start": 805.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "become active drivers of economic", "start": 808.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "transformation and sustainable", "start": 811.12, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "development.", "start": 813.2, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "We are alive to the fact that we should", "start": 814.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "ensure that we keep this youthful and", "start": 817.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "productive population healthy in order", "start": 819.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "to harness positive dividends. In the", "start": 822.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "health sector, Zambia has increased", "start": 824.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "domestic budgetary allocations from", "start": 826.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "approximately 7% to over 10%, enabling", "start": 829.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the recruitment of health workers,", "start": 833.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "expansion and modernization of health", "start": 836.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "infrastructure, and improved", "start": 838.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "availability of essential medical", "start": 840.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "supplies. Recognizing continued", "start": 844.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "vulnerability to epidemics, Zambia calls", "start": 846.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "for the expedited conclusion of", "start": 849.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "negotiations on the pathogen access and", "start": 851.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "benefit sharing annex under the World", "start": 854.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Health Organization pandemic agreement", "start": 857.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "alongside strengthened access to", "start": 860.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "technology and preparedness capabilities", "start": 862.48, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "to def detect and respond to future", "start": 866.0, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "health threats. Zambia is further making", "start": 870.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "efforts towards building capacity for", "start": 873.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "local vaccine manufacturing.", "start": 876.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Mr. President in Zambia, we have taken", "start": 878.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "decisive steps to access to expand", "start": 881.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "access to education through the", "start": 885.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "enactment of the free education act and", "start": 887.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "the strengthening of the school feeding", "start": 890.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "program, ensuring that more children can", "start": 893.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "access education and remain in school", "start": 895.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "without the burden of fees or hunger", "start": 898.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "standing in their way of learning.", "start": 901.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Zambia is equally committed to promoting", "start": 905.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "gender equality and economic empowerment", "start": 908.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "of women and girls. We are expanding", "start": 911.36, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "opportunities in education, skills", "start": 915.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "development, entrepreneurship, financial", "start": 918.639, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "inclusion and leadership. For the first", "start": 921.199, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "time in our history, Parliament now", "start": 924.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "provides for proportional representation", "start": 926.48, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "of women, young people, and persons with", "start": 928.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "disabilities, reflecting our conviction", "start": 931.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "that their voices and experiences must", "start": 934.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "be heard in shaping the decisions that", "start": 937.199, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "affect our nation. We are also", "start": 940.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "strengthening", "start": 944.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "efforts to end child", "start": 946.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "uh and end child early and forced", "start": 949.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "marriage by keeping girls in school and", "start": 952.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "addressing the social and economic", "start": 954.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "factors that place them at risk. Zambia", "start": 957.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "has demonstrated that progress is", "start": 960.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "possible. Reducing child m mar mar mar", "start": 962.56, "duration": 2.56}, {"text": "mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar", "start": 965.12, "duration": 0.079}, {"text": "mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar", "start": 965.12, "duration": 0.079}, {"text": "mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar mar", "start": 965.199, "duration": 0.241}, {"text": "mar mar mar mar mar mar mar marriage", "start": 965.199, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "prevalence from 29 to 23.9%", "start": 965.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in four years through comprehensive", "start": 969.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "legal reforms, free education, school", "start": 972.24, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "entry uh polic re-entry policy, uh", "start": 975.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "multis sectoral support systems like the", "start": 979.12, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "keeping girls in school initiatives and", "start": 981.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "targeted economic investments such as uh", "start": 983.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "our expanded constituency development", "start": 987.04, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "fund,", "start": 989.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "our expanded constitu development fund.", "start": 990.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and we need to continue building on", "start": 993.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "these successes. We therefore invite", "start": 997.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "member states to unite behind our global", "start": 1000.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "and continued commitments to drive", "start": 1003.199, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "domestic action. By inviting our people,", "start": 1005.199, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "particularly women, girls, and young", "start": 1008.399, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "people, we are investing in Zambia's", "start": 1010.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "future. When we empower our people, we", "start": 1013.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "strengthen our nation. And when we", "start": 1016.8, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "invest in Africa's young people and", "start": 1018.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "women, we invest in the prosperity of", "start": 1020.639, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "our continent and the world at large.", "start": 1024.16, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Our commitment is to build an inclusive", "start": 1027.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "society in which every citizen", "start": 1030.799, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "regardless of gender, age, or dis or or", "start": 1033.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "disability has an opportunity to", "start": 1035.919, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "participate fully in our country's", "start": 1038.24, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "economic and social transformation.", "start": 1040.959, "duration": 4.761}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 1046.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "on sustainable development and the 2030", "start": 1049.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "agenda. Zambia takes note that the", "start": 1052.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "sustainable development goals remain the", "start": 1055.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "most comprehensive expression of our", "start": 1058.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "shared ambition to eradicate poverty.", "start": 1060.799, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "Also to reduce inequality and build a", "start": 1065.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "sustainable future. We must acknowledge", "start": 1069.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that progress is uneven. The world", "start": 1072.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "cannot continue to adopt ambitious", "start": 1074.64, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "commitments while developing countries", "start": 1077.28, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "struggle to finance their", "start": 1079.919, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "implementation.", "start": 1081.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "For Zambia, the SDGs must translate into", "start": 1083.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "tangible improvements in the lives of", "start": 1087.36, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "our people. A child receiving quality", "start": 1089.679, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "education. A mother accessing safe", "start": 1092.559, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "health care. A farmer having reliable", "start": 1095.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "water and markets. A young person", "start": 1097.919, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "finding decent employment. And a family", "start": 1100.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "having access to electricity. A", "start": 1103.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "community having accessible roads,", "start": 1105.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "access to clean water and sanitation, a", "start": 1108.4, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "small business gaining access to", "start": 1110.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "finance. That is what development means", "start": 1112.799, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "to us as Zambians.", "start": 1116.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Mr. President, regarding sustainable", "start": 1119.52, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "development, finance and reform of the", "start": 1122.08, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "global financial architecture,", "start": 1124.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "it is widely accepted that sustainable", "start": 1126.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "development cannot be achieved without", "start": 1129.2, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "addressing persistent financing gaps", "start": 1131.28, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "facing developing countries. High", "start": 1133.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "borrowing costs, limited fiscal space,", "start": 1136.559, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "and heavy debt servicing obligations", "start": 1138.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "continue to constrain our country's", "start": 1141.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "ability to invest in climate action,", "start": 1143.6, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "health, education,", "start": 1145.84, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "uh, infrastructure and development", "start": 1147.76, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "priorities.", "start": 1150.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Zambia therefore calls for greater", "start": 1152.799, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "access to affordable and long-term", "start": 1155.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "development finance, increasing", "start": 1158.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "uh increased climate finance,", "start": 1161.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "particularly for adaptation and", "start": 1163.84, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "resilience and innovative finance", "start": 1165.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "mechanisms to mobilize private", "start": 1167.919, "duration": 7.481}, {"text": "investment for sustainable development.", "start": 1170.08, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "Mr. President, I turn to multi", "start": 1175.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "multilateralism, geopolitics, and peace", "start": 1177.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and security. The United Nations remains", "start": 1180.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "indispensable to international peace,", "start": 1183.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "security, and sustainable development.", "start": 1186.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "However, its institutions must evolve to", "start": 1189.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reflect today's geopolitical, economic,", "start": 1192.24, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "and demog demographic realities. Zambia", "start": 1194.88, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "therefore supports meaningful UN reform", "start": 1198.559, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "particularly of the security council", "start": 1201.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "including permanent African", "start": 1204.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "representation in line with the Eulini", "start": 1206.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "consensus and the certain declaration.", "start": 1208.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We also support reforms to global", "start": 1212.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "economic and financial governance that", "start": 1214.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "give developing countries a greater", "start": 1217.6, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "voice in decisions affecting them.", "start": 1220.16, "duration": 7.999}, {"text": "Zambia welcomes UN8 the UN80 initiative", "start": 1223.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "as an opportunity to strengthen", "start": 1228.159, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 1230.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "and build a more effective, efficient,", "start": 1231.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "equitable and fitfor-purpose United", "start": 1234.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Nations and acknowledge the commendable", "start": 1236.64, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "progress achieved so far. In the face of", "start": 1239.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "rising geopolitical tensions and", "start": 1244.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "protected conflicts, we reaffirm our", "start": 1246.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "commitment to dialogue, diplomacy, and", "start": 1248.96, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the peaceful resolution of disputes in", "start": 1251.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "accordance with the UN charter and", "start": 1253.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "international law. We further support", "start": 1256.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "African-led solutions and stronger", "start": 1258.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "cooperation between the UN, the African", "start": 1261.12, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "Union, and regional organizations to", "start": 1264.799, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "advance conflict prevention, peace", "start": 1267.679, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "building, and collective security.", "start": 1270.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Conclusion.", "start": 1273.28, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Mr. President, Zambia remains committed", "start": 1275.12, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "to peace, democracy, multilateralism,", "start": 1278.559, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "and sustainable development. We believe", "start": 1282.559, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "that restoring trust requires delivery,", "start": 1285.679, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that sustainable development requires", "start": 1289.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "genuine international partnership, and", "start": 1291.52, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "that managing transformation requires", "start": 1293.919, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "inclusion. We call for an equitable", "start": 1296.559, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "global system that provides developing", "start": 1300.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "countries with affordable financing and", "start": 1302.559, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "policy space to transform their", "start": 1305.36, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "economies.", "start": 1307.28, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Uh, strengthens climate action through", "start": 1308.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "adequate finance. expands opportunities", "start": 1312.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "for young people and reforms", "start": 1315.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "international institutions to reflect", "start": 1317.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "today's realities.", "start": 1319.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Let us together strengthen peace through", "start": 1322.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "dialogue, respect for human rights,", "start": 1325.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "democracy, and the rule of law and", "start": 1328.159, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "ensure that the commitments made in this", "start": 1330.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "assembly translate into tangible", "start": 1333.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "improvement in the lives of our people.", "start": 1336.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "Zambia stands ready to work with all", "start": 1339.919, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "nations to restore trust to manage", "start": 1342.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "transformation and build a more", "start": 1345.6, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "peaceful, prosperous and equitable", "start": 1347.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "world. I thank you all for your kind", "start": 1351.039, "duration": 5.721}, {"text": "attention.", "start": 1353.76, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "[applause]", "start": 1359.795, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": "I thank the Minister for Foreign Affairs", "start": 1366.08, "duration": 8.599}, {"text": "and International Cooperation of Zambia.", "start": 1369.36, "duration": 5.319}]